---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Página no encontrada | Padilla Peritaciones"
  description="La página que buscas no existe. Vuelve al inicio o consulta nuestros servicios de peritación de vehículos en Alicante."
  noindex={true}
>

<style>
  :root {
    --primary: #226D94;
    --primary-dark: #1a5878;
    --primary-xlight: #e8f4f9;
    --text: #0f1e2e;
    --text-muted: #5c7080;
    --border: #dce8f0;
  }

  * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
  body {
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
    background: #f4f8fb;
    color: var(--text);
    min-height: 100vh;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 40px 24px;
  }

  .card {
    background: white;
    border: 1.5px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 24px;
    padding: 60px 48px;
    max-width: 520px;
    width: 100%;
    text-align: center;
    box-shadow: 0 6px 30px rgba(34,109,148,0.12);
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .card::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: 0; left: 0; right: 0;
    height: 4px;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, #226D94, #2f82b0);
  }

  .logo-wrap { margin-bottom: 32px; }
  .logo-wrap img { height: 40px; width: auto; }

  .code {
    font-size: 80px;
    font-weight: 900;
    color: var(--primary);
    font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif;
    line-height: 1;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
    letter-spacing: -0.04em;
  }

  h1 {
    font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif;
    font-size: 26px;
    font-weight: 800;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }

  p {
    font-size: 16px;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin-bottom: 36px;
  }

  .actions { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px; }

  .btn {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 8px;
    padding: 14px 28px;
    border-radius: 50px;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 15px;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: all 0.2s;
    font-family: inherit;
    border: none;
    cursor: pointer;
  }
  .btn-primary { background: var(--primary); color: white; box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(34,109,148,0.3); }
  .btn-primary:hover { background: var(--primary-dark); transform: translateY(-2px); }
  .btn-secondary { background: white; color: var(--primary); border: 2px solid var(--primary); }
  .btn-secondary:hover { background: var(--primary-xlight); transform: translateY(-2px); }

  @media (max-width: 560px) {
    .card { padding: 40px 24px; }
    .code { font-size: 64px; }
    h1 { font-size: 22px; }
  }
</style>

<div class="card">
  <div class="logo-wrap">
    <img src="/img/logo-negro.png" alt="Padilla Peritaciones" />
  </div>
  <div class="code">404</div>
  <h1>Página no encontrada</h1>
  <p>La página que buscas no existe o ha sido movida. Puedes volver al inicio o consultar nuestros servicios.</p>
  <div class="actions">
    <a href="/" class="btn btn-primary">Volver al inicio</a>
    <a href="/contacto" class="btn btn-secondary">Contactar</a>
  </div>
</div>

</Layout>
